    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '<color=#73D9FF><b>DEFEND THE CORE</b></color>

    Enemies march on the core in waves. Click them before they reach it. Survive as many waves as you can.


    <color=#FFC94C><b>AMMO</b></color>

    Your clip holds <b>6 shots</b> (+3 per <i>Extended Clip</i> perk) and <b>refills one shot at a time</b> on its own. Enemies sometimes drop <b>gold ammo charges</b> that fly to the core and refill the clip instantly, more often when you''re low.


    <color=#C780FF><b>SOULS & ORBS</b></color>

    Kills give souls. Shoot the orbs they drop: purple = souls, green = a shield charge.'
