--- !u!114 &7620667073256562711
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3201346745528521338}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 0.86}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 22
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 1
    m_MinSize: 15
    m_MaxSize: 22
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '<color=#73D9FF><b>THE WEAPON RING</b></color>

    The ring around the core is cut into <b>slots</b>. Every shot goes through the slot your aim crosses, and that slot decides <b>what</b> you fire.


    - Plain slots fire your <b>basic shot</b>.

    - Each <b>technique</b> you buy adds one <b>special slot</b> (glowing, with an icon). It fires once, then empties and <b>reloads a random technique you own</b>.

    - Every wave the ring <b>re-rolls</b>: a new random slot count (5 to 12, never fewer than your techniques) and a new layout. That''s why the number of slots changes.

    - The ring slowly turns, so aim where the special slot is.


    <color=#C780FF><b>SHOP</b></color>

    Between waves spend souls on buffs and techniques. Some techniques combine into <b>synergies</b>.'
--- !u!114 &152741074846200623
